WEBVTT

00:01.373 --> 00:04.373
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

00:04.373 --> 00:10.573
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:11.906 --> 00:13.673
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

00:13.673 --> 00:14.939
[laughing]
[笑]

00:16.873 --> 00:19.006
[groaning]
[呻吟]

00:19.006 --> 00:20.839
Ahh. [grunts]
啊。 [咕哝]

00:20.839 --> 00:21.973
Phew!
唷！

00:24.206 --> 00:25.406
- What's that?
- 那是什么？

00:25.406 --> 00:27.406
- Looks like a box.
- 看起来像一个盒子。

00:27.406 --> 00:29.273
- Wonder who it belongs to.
- 想知道它属于谁。

00:29.273 --> 00:32.073
[grunts]
Maybe it says on the other side.
[咕哝]
或许另一边也这么说。

00:32.073 --> 00:33.073
both: Nope.
两人：没有。

00:33.073 --> 00:34.406
- Oh, look, it's open.
- 哦，看，它已经打开了。

00:34.406 --> 00:35.573
- It is?
- 这是？

00:35.573 --> 00:37.339
- [grunts]
Yup.
- [咕哝]
是的。

00:37.339 --> 00:39.473
- Ooh.
- 哦。

00:39.473 --> 00:40.939
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

00:42.473 --> 00:44.239
It's--
它是 -

00:44.239 --> 00:45.973
it's--
它是 -

00:45.973 --> 00:47.073
[whimpers]
[呜咽]

00:47.073 --> 00:48.339
It's stuff!
是东西啊！

00:48.339 --> 00:50.339
- [laughs]
Oh, I knew it!
- [笑]
哦，我知道了！

00:50.339 --> 00:53.106
But what does this stuff do?
但这东西有什么作用呢？

00:53.106 --> 00:54.439
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

00:54.439 --> 00:55.973
both: Hmm.
两人：嗯。

00:55.973 --> 00:59.339
- Ah, this must be for getting
books off the top shelf.
- 啊，这一定是为了得到
书架上的书。

00:59.339 --> 01:01.573
- Hey! [laughs]
- 嘿！ [笑]

01:01.573 --> 01:03.273
Oh! [groans]
哦！ [呻吟]

01:03.273 --> 01:05.839
Hmm. Mm.
唔。毫米。

01:07.673 --> 01:09.173
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:09.173 --> 01:11.739
Wow.
哇。

01:13.773 --> 01:17.639
This is must be
a whipped cream holder.
这必须是
鲜奶油架。

01:17.639 --> 01:19.039
Mmm.
嗯。

01:20.306 --> 01:21.473
[moans]
[呻吟声]

01:21.473 --> 01:22.873
[grunts]
[咕哝]

01:22.873 --> 01:24.973
- Ah!
Patrick, are you okay?
- 啊！
帕特里克，你还好吗？

01:26.406 --> 01:29.973
[moaning]
[呻吟]

01:29.973 --> 01:31.606
Yum.
嗯。

01:35.439 --> 01:37.373
- Meow.
- This must be
- 喵。
- 这一定是

01:37.373 --> 01:39.673
a portable snail bed.
便携式蜗牛床。

01:39.673 --> 01:41.373
* Rock-a-bye Gary
*摇滚再见加里

01:41.373 --> 01:42.939
- I wanna try!
- 我想尝试！

01:42.939 --> 01:44.073
[grunts]
- Meow.
[咕哝]
- 喵。

01:44.073 --> 01:45.306
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

01:45.306 --> 01:47.339
[snores]
[打鼾]

01:47.339 --> 01:49.473
- Aww. [chuckles]
- 哇。 [笑声]

01:49.473 --> 01:51.239
[pleasant music]
[悦耳的音乐]

01:51.239 --> 01:53.773
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

01:53.773 --> 01:56.939
Oh, it may have taken you
all morning, Squidward,
哦，它可能已经带走了你
整个早上，章鱼哥，

01:56.939 --> 02:00.573
but this is a meal
fit for a king.
但这是一顿饭
适合国王。

02:00.573 --> 02:01.606
[bell dings]
Oh.
[铃声]
哦。

02:01.606 --> 02:04.373
My croque-madame is ready.
我的法式三明治夫人准备好了。

02:08.339 --> 02:10.106
What the--
[grunts]
什么是——
[咕哝]

02:10.106 --> 02:11.973
[both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

02:11.973 --> 02:13.573
[growls]
[咆哮]

02:13.573 --> 02:15.006
SpongeBob! Patrick!
海绵宝宝！帕特里克！

02:15.006 --> 02:17.339
What do you two
think you're--
你们两个做什么
认为你是——

02:17.339 --> 02:18.439
wow.
哇。

02:18.439 --> 02:20.339
- [laughs]
- [humming]
- [笑]
- [嗡嗡声]

02:20.339 --> 02:21.839
both: Hiyah!
- [laughs]
两人：嗨！
- [笑]

02:24.573 --> 02:26.206
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

02:26.206 --> 02:28.339
- My begonias!
- 我的秋海棠！

02:28.339 --> 02:33.173
What are you lunk heads doing
with all this equipment?
你们这些笨蛋在做什么
有这些设备吗？

02:33.173 --> 02:35.106
both: Equipment?
两人：装备？

02:35.106 --> 02:39.173
- You don't know
what this stuff is?
- 你不知道
这东西是什么？

02:39.173 --> 02:41.106
both: Mm-mmm. Mm-mmm.
两人：嗯嗯。嗯嗯。

02:41.106 --> 02:43.439
- This is a soccer ball...
- 这是一个足球...

02:43.439 --> 02:46.639
that is a tennis racket,
and these...
那是一个网球拍，
还有这些...

02:46.639 --> 02:48.606
are a couple of morons.
是一对白痴。

02:48.606 --> 02:50.106
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

02:50.106 --> 02:51.573
Now, be quiet!
现在，安静点！

02:51.573 --> 02:53.906
And clean up
all of your sports junk!
并清理干净
你所有的运动垃圾！

02:55.239 --> 02:57.573
both: What's a "sportz"?
两者：什么是“sportz”？

02:57.573 --> 03:00.273
- [groans]
Sports are games
- [呻吟]
体育就是游戏

03:00.273 --> 03:01.606
you play for points.
你玩游戏是为了积分。

03:01.606 --> 03:04.573
The points determine
the winner of the game.
点决定
游戏的获胜者。

03:04.573 --> 03:06.806
- Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh!
I love games!
- 哦！哦！哦！哦！哦！
我喜欢游戏！

03:06.806 --> 03:08.573
- Me too!
You must know a lot
- 我也是！
你一定知道很多

03:08.573 --> 03:10.006
about "sportz," Squidward.
关于《sportz》，《章鱼哥》。

03:10.006 --> 03:11.906
Will you teach us
how to play?
你会教我们吗
怎么玩？

03:11.906 --> 03:15.339
- I can't think of anything
I'd rather do less than--
-我什么也想不出来
我宁愿做的比——

03:15.339 --> 03:16.839
[twinkling]
[闪烁]

03:16.839 --> 03:20.673
- Now now, Squidward.
You need to help them.
-现在现在，章鱼哥。
你需要帮助他们。

03:20.673 --> 03:25.273
Played incorrectly,
sports can be very dangerous.
玩错了，
运动可能非常危险。

03:25.273 --> 03:27.373
- Yeah, he's right.
You should teach 'em
- 是的，他是对的。
你应该教他们

03:27.373 --> 03:31.573
to play wrong,
'cause it's payback time.
玩错了，
因为现在是回报的时候了。

03:31.573 --> 03:33.306
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

03:33.306 --> 03:36.039
Let 'em have it,
right between the eyes.
让他们拥有吧
就在眼睛之间。

03:37.639 --> 03:41.839
- You know, on second thought,
I'd be happy to teach you
- 你知道，再想一想，
我很乐意教你

03:41.839 --> 03:44.573
all about sports,
SpongeBob.
关于运动的一切，
海绵宝宝。

03:44.573 --> 03:46.706
[evil chuckle]
[邪恶的笑声]

03:48.806 --> 03:50.639
All right, the object
of this game
好吧，对象
这个游戏的

03:50.639 --> 03:54.173
is to throw the horseshoe
around the stick.
就是扔马蹄铁
棍子周围。

03:55.239 --> 03:56.573
- Ah, seems easy enough.
- 啊，看起来很简单。

03:56.573 --> 04:01.239
- Sure, but you have to do it...
blindfolded.
- 当然可以，但是你必须这么做......
蒙住眼睛。

04:01.239 --> 04:02.906
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

04:02.906 --> 04:04.339
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:04.339 --> 04:05.839
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

04:05.839 --> 04:06.673
[groans]
[呻吟]

04:06.673 --> 04:09.106
Um, do we throw now?
嗯，我们现在扔吗？

04:09.106 --> 04:11.073
- Yes.
- At the same time?
- 是的。
- 同时？

04:11.073 --> 04:14.406
- Yes! Throw it
at the same time. Throw.
- 是的！扔掉它
同时。扔。

04:14.406 --> 04:15.439
- Hiyah!
-嗨！

04:15.439 --> 04:16.606
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

04:16.606 --> 04:18.006
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

04:18.006 --> 04:20.106
- Ow!
- 噢！

04:20.106 --> 04:22.306
Aw, we didn't hit the sticks.
Did we do bad?
哦，我们没有撞到棍子。
我们做坏事了吗？

04:23.373 --> 04:24.639
- My face hurts.
- 我的脸很痛。

04:24.639 --> 04:27.073
- Oh, no, no, no.
You both did good.
- 哦，不，不，不。
你们俩都做得很好。

04:27.073 --> 04:30.639
Pain is--
uh, worth points.
痛苦是——
嗯，值得积分。

04:30.639 --> 04:34.739
You know the phrase,
"no pain, no gain."
你知道这句话，
“没有痛苦，就没有收获。”

04:34.739 --> 04:36.339
- [laughs]
- [笑]

04:36.339 --> 04:38.573
I want pain points!
我要痛点！

04:38.573 --> 04:40.006
[grunts]
[horse whinnies]
[咕哝]
[马嘶声]

04:40.006 --> 04:40.839
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:40.839 --> 04:42.139
- Yeah, that's great.
- 是的，那太好了。

04:42.139 --> 04:45.206
Now do it--
oh, 100 more times.
现在就做——
哦，再100次。

04:45.206 --> 04:46.339
- Yeah!
- 是的！

04:48.306 --> 04:49.339
[grunts]
[咕哝]

04:49.339 --> 04:51.039
Ow!
噢！

04:51.039 --> 04:54.773
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

04:54.773 --> 04:58.673
- Oh, Squiddy,
you're a genius.
-哦，鱿鱼，
你是个天才。

04:58.673 --> 05:00.706
- Squidward, can the game
be over now?
- 章鱼哥，可以玩游戏吗
现在结束了吗？

05:00.706 --> 05:02.739
All this pain is
starting to hurt.
这一切的痛苦都是
开始受伤。

05:02.739 --> 05:05.673
- Oh, sorry.
There's no way to end the game
- 哦，抱歉。
没有办法结束游戏

05:05.673 --> 05:07.373
without one of you winning.
你们中没有人获胜。

05:07.373 --> 05:09.439
[both groan]
[两人都呻吟]

05:09.439 --> 05:12.006
- Ready...set...go!
- 准备...开始...出发！

05:13.073 --> 05:14.106
[chuckles]
[笑声]

05:14.106 --> 05:15.439
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

05:15.439 --> 05:17.306
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

05:17.306 --> 05:19.606
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

05:19.606 --> 05:21.139
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

05:22.239 --> 05:23.273
[gasps]
[喘气]

05:23.273 --> 05:24.606
[spits]
[吐口水]

05:24.606 --> 05:26.239
Squidward, are you sure
we're doing this right?
章鱼哥，你确定吗？
我们这样做对吗？

05:26.239 --> 05:28.673
These running shoes are
really hurting my ankles.
这双跑鞋是
真的很伤我的脚踝。

05:28.673 --> 05:30.839
- Oh, you're absolutely
doing it right.
- 哦，你绝对是
做对了。

05:30.839 --> 05:32.306
Try to pick up the pace,
though.
努力加快步伐，
不过。

05:32.306 --> 05:33.306
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

05:33.306 --> 05:34.306
Comin' through!
来了！

05:34.306 --> 05:36.439
- [groaning]
- [呻吟]

05:36.439 --> 05:38.439
[both groaning]
[两人都呻吟]

05:38.439 --> 05:40.139
- I wanna play, Daddy.
- 我想玩，爸爸。

05:40.139 --> 05:43.273
- No, son.
We're sports "fans."
- 不，儿子。
我们是体育“粉丝”。

05:43.273 --> 05:44.673
We just watch.
我们只是看着。

05:46.673 --> 05:48.239
- And...time.
- 还有……时间。

05:48.239 --> 05:49.106
[both panting]
[两人都气喘吁吁]

05:49.106 --> 05:51.173
Let's see those ankles.
让我们看看那些脚踝。

05:52.739 --> 05:54.573
[ankles thumping]
[脚踝重击]

05:54.573 --> 05:57.706
- [gasps]
Oh, yeah, those look bad.
- [喘气]
哦，是的，那些看起来很糟糕。

05:57.706 --> 06:00.673
You both get--
mm, 50 points.
你们俩都会得到——
毫米，50分。

06:00.673 --> 06:03.039
Why not?
- Hey, then we're still tied!
为什么不呢？
- 嘿，那我们还是打平了！

06:03.039 --> 06:06.239
[marching band music]
[行进乐队音乐]

06:06.239 --> 06:07.706
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:07.706 --> 06:09.273
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

06:12.406 --> 06:13.473
[groaning]
[呻吟]

06:13.473 --> 06:16.239
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

06:16.239 --> 06:18.306
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

06:19.439 --> 06:20.773
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

06:24.606 --> 06:25.673
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

06:25.673 --> 06:27.706
[buzzing]
[嗡嗡声]

06:27.706 --> 06:29.573
- [groans]
- [呻吟]

06:29.573 --> 06:32.473
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

06:32.473 --> 06:33.806
- [screams]
- [sobbing]
- [尖叫]
- [抽泣]

06:33.806 --> 06:36.206
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

06:36.206 --> 06:38.206
- Hmm. Hmm.
- 唔。唔。

06:38.206 --> 06:40.039
Where is it!
Where is it?
它在哪里！
它在哪里？

06:40.039 --> 06:42.906
Hmm. Ah-ha!
There's my box of sports gear.
唔。啊哈！
这是我的运动装备盒。

06:42.906 --> 06:44.773
It must've fallen
off the mail truck.
一定是掉下来了
从邮车上下来。

06:44.773 --> 06:46.173
But what happened
to all the equipment?
但发生了什么事
到所有设备？

06:46.173 --> 06:47.906
[bell dings]
[crowd cheering]
[铃声]
[人群欢呼]

06:47.906 --> 06:49.573
What was that?
那是什么？

06:49.573 --> 06:51.106
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

06:51.106 --> 06:52.439
Huh?
啊？

06:52.439 --> 06:54.339
[both groaning]
SpongeBob, what's going on?
[两人都呻吟]
海绵宝宝，这是怎么回事？

06:54.339 --> 06:56.606
- Oh, hey--Sandy.
[both grunting]
- 哦，嘿 - 桑迪。
[两人都咕哝着]

06:56.606 --> 06:57.939
Patrick and I are--
[grunts]
帕特里克和我是——
[咕哝]

06:57.939 --> 06:59.339
in the middle
of a sports game.
在中间
的一场体育比赛。

06:59.339 --> 07:01.173
- [grunts]
- This sure don't look
- [咕哝]
- 这看起来肯定不像

07:01.173 --> 07:03.173
like any sport
I've seen before.
像任何运动一样
我以前见过。

07:03.173 --> 07:04.573
[both grunting]
[两人都咕哝着]

07:04.573 --> 07:08.606
- I believe it's called
kickboxing, or something?
- 我相信它叫
跆拳道什么的？

07:08.606 --> 07:12.906
- Well, whatever it is, it seems
to be causing you lots of pain.
- 好吧，不管是什么，看起来
给你带来很多痛苦。

07:12.906 --> 07:14.773
- Ow!
Sure is.
- 噢！
当然是。

07:14.773 --> 07:16.206
Ooh!
哦！

07:16.206 --> 07:18.573
- Why not stop playing it
if it hurts so bad?
- 为什么不停止玩它
如果疼得那么厉害吗？

07:18.573 --> 07:19.873
- We can't stop...
- 我们无法停止...

07:19.873 --> 07:22.873
[panting]
Until we break our tie.
[气喘吁吁]
直到我们打破领带。

07:22.873 --> 07:23.906
- Says who?
- 谁说的？

07:23.906 --> 07:26.239
[musical fanfare]
[音乐号角]

07:26.239 --> 07:28.639
- It's the rule giver.
- 这是规则的制定者。

07:28.639 --> 07:33.773
[all murmuring]
[大家窃窃私语]

07:34.873 --> 07:36.106
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

07:36.106 --> 07:37.573
- I ain't never heard
of a rule giver.
- 我从来没听说过
一个规则的制定者。

07:39.206 --> 07:41.573
- I prefer
"King of Sports,"
- 我更喜欢
“运动之王”

07:41.573 --> 07:45.173
but you can never tell what will
catch on with the small folk.
但你永远不知道会发生什么
与小人物相处。

07:45.173 --> 07:47.573
- You're making up a game
where SpongeBob and Patrick
- 你正在编一个游戏
海绵宝宝和派大星在那里

07:47.573 --> 07:50.306
hurt themselves,
and you won't let them stop?
伤害自己，
你不让他们停下来吗？

07:50.306 --> 07:53.173
- I'm just giving the people
what they want.
- 我只是给人们
他们想要什么。

07:53.173 --> 07:56.106
- That's pretty low, Squidward,
even for you.
- 这相当低了，章鱼哥，
即使是为了你。

07:56.106 --> 07:57.439
I'm putting a stop to this.
我要制止这一切。

07:57.439 --> 08:00.206
SpongeBob and Patrick
have had enough!
海绵宝宝和帕特里克
已经受够了！

08:00.206 --> 08:02.039
[all gasp]
[全都喘气]

08:02.039 --> 08:03.839
- See?
They're fine.
- 看？
他们很好。

08:03.839 --> 08:06.639
Let the games resume.
让比赛继续进行吧。

08:06.639 --> 08:08.706
- [grumbles]
[crowd cheering]
- [抱怨]
[人群欢呼]

08:08.706 --> 08:10.706
Oh, I don't think so.
哦，我不这么认为。

08:10.706 --> 08:12.906
Y'all want to see a game?
Fine.
你们想看比赛吗？
美好的。

08:12.906 --> 08:15.973
Squidward, I challenge you
to a game--
章鱼哥，我向你挑战
来一场比赛——

08:15.973 --> 08:17.973
a game of basketball.
一场篮球比赛。

08:17.973 --> 08:21.573
Winner decides the fate
of SpongeBob and Patrick.
胜者决定命运
海绵宝宝和帕特里克。

08:21.573 --> 08:22.973
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:22.973 --> 08:24.673
Huh?
[crowd murmuring]
啊？
[人群窃窃私语]

08:24.673 --> 08:26.439
Me? Play sports?
我？做运动吗？

08:26.439 --> 08:29.639
No, no. I'm mostly
in an advisory position.
不，不。我主要是
担任顾问职务。

08:29.639 --> 08:33.273
- Aw, come on!
We came to see some action.
- 噢，来吧！
我们是来看一些行动的。

08:33.273 --> 08:36.573
Play the squirrel!
Play the squirrel!
玩松鼠吧！
玩松鼠吧！

08:36.573 --> 08:39.873
all: Play the squirrel!
Play the squirrel!
全体：扮演松鼠！
玩松鼠吧！

08:39.873 --> 08:42.706
- See you on the court,
Your Highness.
- 球场见
殿下。

08:42.706 --> 08:43.873
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

08:43.873 --> 08:44.939
[moans]
[呻吟声]

08:44.939 --> 08:46.873
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

08:46.873 --> 08:48.973
- Hey, Squidward,
one more thing.
- 嘿，章鱼哥，
还有一件事。

08:48.973 --> 08:53.406
We're playing
San Antonio rules.
我们正在玩
圣安东尼奥规则。

08:53.406 --> 08:54.639
- San "A-what-io" rules?
- San“A-what-io”规则？

08:54.639 --> 08:56.373
- Check.
- [grunts]
- 查看。
- [咕哝]

08:56.373 --> 08:57.539
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:57.539 --> 09:00.239
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:00.239 --> 09:01.939
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

09:01.939 --> 09:03.606
- Oh, that was a foul.
- 哦，那是犯规。

09:03.606 --> 09:05.639
- Tell it to yo Mama,
Squidward.
- 告诉你妈妈，
章鱼哥。

09:05.639 --> 09:06.639
- Mama?
- 妈妈？

09:06.639 --> 09:08.739
- Don't want to hear it.
- 不想听。

09:08.739 --> 09:10.006
- Next round's soccer.
- 下一轮的足球比赛。

09:10.006 --> 09:11.339
- What the what?
- Sure.
- 什么什么？
- 当然。

09:11.339 --> 09:13.406
Every time you score,
you pick a new sport.
每次你进球的时候，
你选择一项新运动。

09:13.406 --> 09:15.306
I thought you knew
all the rules, Squidward.
我以为你知道
所有规则，章鱼哥。

09:15.306 --> 09:18.039
- Well, uh, yeah, well,
of course I do. Yeah.
- 呃，呃，是的，好吧，
我当然知道。是的。

09:18.039 --> 09:19.839
- Good, then block this.
- 好，那就阻止这个。

09:19.839 --> 09:21.439
[cheers and applause]
- Block what?
[欢呼和掌声]
- 阻止什么？

09:22.606 --> 09:23.873
- Ha!
- 哈！

09:23.873 --> 09:26.573
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

09:26.573 --> 09:29.773
[groaning]
[呻吟]

09:29.773 --> 09:32.039
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

09:32.039 --> 09:34.639
- Oh, come on,
I wasn't even ready.
- 哦，来吧，
我什至还没准备好。

09:34.639 --> 09:36.839
- No time outs.
Football round!
- 没有超时。
足球赛！

09:36.839 --> 09:38.139
[horn blares]
[喇叭声]

09:38.139 --> 09:39.939
[growling]
- [screams]
[咆哮]
- [尖叫]

09:39.939 --> 09:41.273
[groans]
[呻吟]

09:43.306 --> 09:44.139
[groans]
[呻吟]

09:44.139 --> 09:46.239
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

09:46.239 --> 09:49.373
[panting]
Just give me a second to--
[气喘吁吁]
请给我一点时间——

09:50.606 --> 09:52.006
[grunts]
[咕哝]

09:52.006 --> 09:53.439
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

09:53.439 --> 09:54.573
- [screams]
- [尖叫]

09:54.573 --> 09:57.273
[playful music]
[俏皮的音乐]

09:57.273 --> 10:01.073
[groaning]
[呻吟]

10:01.073 --> 10:03.273
[horn blares]
[喇叭声]

10:03.273 --> 10:04.473
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

10:04.473 --> 10:06.573
[grunts, babbles]
[咕哝声，胡言乱语]

10:06.573 --> 10:13.473
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

10:14.773 --> 10:16.373
[groans]
[呻吟]

10:16.373 --> 10:21.173
- And the winner is...
Sandy Cheeks.
- 获胜者是...
桑迪脸颊。

10:21.173 --> 10:22.173
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

10:22.173 --> 10:23.939
- Good game, Squidward.
- 好游戏，章鱼哥。

10:23.939 --> 10:25.306
- Ow, ow, ow.
- 噢，噢，噢。

10:25.306 --> 10:27.673
- Wow, Sandy.
That was amazing.
- 哇，桑迪。
太棒了。

10:27.673 --> 10:29.239
- Yeah, I liked the part
- 是的，我喜欢这个部分

10:29.239 --> 10:32.173
where you did that thing
with the ball and stuff.
你在哪里做那件事
与球和其他东西。

10:32.173 --> 10:34.039
- [laughs]
Thanks, boys.
- [笑]
谢谢，孩子们。

10:34.039 --> 10:35.573
Looks like we're
all done here.
看来我们是
一切都在这里完成。

10:35.573 --> 10:39.306
That goes for you too.
I'm ending your game.
这也适合你。
我要结束你的游戏了

10:39.306 --> 10:42.573
- [gulps]
But we're still tied.
- [吞咽]
但我们仍然是绑在一起的。

10:42.573 --> 10:45.573
- Don't worry,
I'm declaring you both winners.
- 别担心，
我宣布你们俩都是赢家。

10:45.573 --> 10:49.273
both: Yeah! We're winners!
We're winners! We're winners!
两人：是啊！我们是赢家！
我们是赢家！我们是赢家！

10:49.273 --> 10:51.006
- Aww, don't worry,
Squidward.
- 哇，别担心，
章鱼哥。

10:51.006 --> 10:52.906
[all groaning]
You're a winner too.
[全都呻吟]
你也是赢家。

10:52.906 --> 10:54.439
- I hate winning.
- 我讨厌获胜。

10:56.006 --> 10:59.673
Ow.
噢。

10:59.673 --> 11:02.673
[quirky music]
[古怪的音乐]

11:02.673 --> 11:09.606
*
*
*
*

